      consent to participate was waived by the CAG under this Sect. 251 approval. This 
      study used data provided by University Hospitals of Leicester as part of their 
      submissions to the UKRR audit of AKI, these data were then used for research. 
      Patient data were linked to Hospital Episode Statistics (HES) and Office for 
      National Statistics (ONS) mortality records held by NHS England to obtain 
      follow-up information. This linkage was performed securely under all required 
      ethical and legal approvals. No patient contact or intervention was involved. 
      Individual patient consent was therefore not required for this study. This study 
      was conducted in accordance with the Declaration of Helsinki. Consent for 
      publication: Individual informed consent for publication was waived by the 
