AB  - Objectives-This report presents a mortality profile of the U.S. non-Hispanic 
      American Indian or Alaska Native (AIAN) population for 2019. Standard mortality 
      statistics, adjusted for race and Hispanic-origin misclassification on death 
      certificates, are provided along with comparisons with the three major U.S. 
      populations: non-Hispanic white, non-Hispanic black, and Hispanic.
