TI  - Post-cesarean section puerperal morbidity. The incidence and risk factors at 
      Srinagarind Hospital.
PG  - 173-7
AB  - We found that the incidence of post-cesarean puerperal morbidity at Srinagarind 
      Hospital, Khon Kaen University was 5.5 per cent, which is very low compared to 
      other reports. Statistically significant risk factors for post-cesarean puerperal 
      morbidity included having less than 4 antenatal care visits, duration of labour 
      longer than 12 hours and absence of prophylactic antibiotics.
FAU - Pothinam, S
AU  - Pothinam S
